          "maintenance_status": "active",
          "changelog": "Architecture release: the twin now builds on the tagged twinkit v0.1.0 library and carries auditable provenance. No API surface changes.\n\n### Changed\n- Publisher is now `localstack`: this twin is published by LocalStack (CTO-50)\n- Removed the internal workspace engine wiring: invoice, subscription and payment_intent lifecycles were already owned by the handlers and store; behavior is unchanged and covered by the existing tests and conformance checks\n- Provenance now points at the pinned research archive: OpenAPI spec pinned to commit 3b6451b (2026-04-22.dahlia) with sha256, recorded as the conformance reference; the twin's generation target remains stripe-go v81 / API 2024-12-18\n- Built against twinkit v0.1.0 (first tagged release) instead of an untagged checkout\n"
